<title>SWEDEN: Swedish April trade surplus 12.3 billion crowns.</title>
<headline>Swedish April trade surplus 12.3 billion crowns.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's April trade surplus</p>
<p>was 12.3 billion crowns, Statistics Sweden said on Monday.</p>
<p> SWEDISH TRADE BALANCE     April '97  March '97  April '96</p>
<p> Trade balance		 12.3	 10.4	 10.2</p>
<p> Imports			 44.8	 40.7	 38.2</p>
<p> Exports			 57.1	 51.1	 48.4</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of crowns. Analysts polled by Reuters had forecast a 9.9 billion crown surplus.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom, 46-8-700-1017</p>
